  <script id="__PWS_INITIAL_PROPS__"
    type="application/json">{"otaData":{"deltas":{"Bring Pinterest Ads capabilities into the AI tools your team already uses. Query, analyze, and act through a consistent interface powered by the existing Pinterest API. --- mcpPage.features.workflowsDescription":"Bring Pinterest Ads capabilities into the AI tools your team already uses. Query, analyse and act through a consistent interface powered by the existing Pinterest API.","Built on MCP, with compatibility across tools such as Claude, Cursor, and VS Code. --- mcpPage.features.openStandardDescription":"Built on MCP, with compatibility across tools such as Claude, Cursor and VS Code.","Get updates, developer resources, and integration guides delivered straight to your inbox. --- mcpPage.reminder.subtext":"Get updates, developer resources and integration guides delivered straight to your inbox.","Model Context Protocol (MCP) is an open standard that enables AI assistants to connect directly with external services. The Pinterest MCP Server brings Pinterest data into the AI tools you already use, giving agents native access to rich inspiration and creative signals — without custom code or fragile integrations. It helps teams move from idea to on-brand creative direction with Pinterest intelligence available right where they work. --- mcpPage.whatIsIt.description":"Model Context Protocol (MCP) is an open standard that enables AI assistants to connect directly with external services. The Pinterest MCP Server brings Pinterest data into the AI tools you already use, giving agents native access to rich inspiration and creative signals – without custom code or fragile integrations. It helps teams move from idea to on-brand creative direction with Pinterest intelligence available directly where they work.","Pinterest MCP Server brings the power of Pinterest data directly into the AI assistants, copilots, and agentic workflows you already use. Turn natural-language questions into fast, actionable insights, uncover performance opportunities in moments, and build what's next with more momentum than ever. More Pinterest. More possibilities. --- mcpPage.hero.subtext":"Pinterest MCP Server brings the power of Pinterest data directly into the AI assistants, co-pilots and agentic workflows you already use. Turn natural-language questions into fast, actionable insights, uncover performance opportunities in moments and build what's next with more momentum than ever. More Pinterest. More possibilities.","Set up the Pinterest MCP Server once in your preferred AI environment. From there, you can search Pins, explore and manage Boards, uncover emerging trends, and access audience insights — all through natural-language prompts without leaving your chat or editor. --- mcpPage.howItWorks.description":"Set up the Pinterest MCP Server once in your preferred AI environment. From there, you can search for Pins, explore and manage Boards, uncover emerging trends and access audience insights – all through natural-language prompts without leaving your chat or editor.","Skip custom API wrappers. The MCP server manages authentication, rate limits, and response formatting, so teams can move faster. --- mcpPage.features.lessWorkDescription":"Skip custom API wrappers. The MCP server manages authentication, rate limits and response formatting, so teams can move faster.","The server is designed for MCP-compatible clients, including Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, GitHub Copilot, and Copilot Studio. Compatibility can vary by client and its MCP support. --- mcpPage.faq.compatibilityAnswer":"The server is designed for MCP-compatible clients, including Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, GitHub Copilot and Copilot Studio. Compatibility can vary by client and its MCP support.","Third-party mobile apps --- [m10n] createFlow.adGroupForm.audienceExtension.summaryLabel":"Third-party mobile apps","Turn insights into action — create, update, and optimize with confidence. --- mcpPage.howItWorks.highlig